          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 147898,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Immagina un array come una barra dell'inventario. Uno slot può contenere qualsiasi variabile o valore, che sia una stringa, un booleano o un numero come <code>100</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 147899,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ogni elemento in un array ha una posizione numerata chiamata indice.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 147900,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gli indici iniziano da 0 e aumentano con ogni valore successivo. Questo significa che il secondo elemento in <code>playerStats</code> si trova all'indice <code>1</code>. Codifica quell'indice.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147901,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per accedere a un elemento come il valore <code>true</code>, scrivi il nome dell'array <code>playerStats</code> seguito dall'indice dell'elemento tra parentesi quadre <code>[2]</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>playerStats</code>, seguito da <code>[</code> e poi <code>2</code>, <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 147902,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per aggiornare il valore al secondo indice, accedilo tramite <code>playerStats[2]</code>, poi usa <code>=</code> per assegnargli un nuovo valore come <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerStats[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>playerStats[2]</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 147903,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nonostante l'array contenga quattro elementi, l'ultimo indice a cui possiamo accedere è <code>3</code> perché l'indicizzazione inizia da 0.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerStats[\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;mage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 147904,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quali tipi di valori può memorizzare un array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Qualsiasi valore, incluse stringhe, numeri e booleani</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo stringhe</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Qualsiasi valore, incluse stringhe, numeri e booleani.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 147905,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come chiamiamo la posizione di un elemento in un array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">L'indice dell'elemento</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il numero dell'elemento</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">L'indice dell'elemento.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 147906,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale indice ha l'elemento in questo array?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 147907,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come accediamo a un elemento di questo array?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" loot = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>loot[1]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>loot[\"gem\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>loot[1]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 147908,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come si aggiorna un valore in un array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Accediamo al valore tramite il suo indice, poi assegniamo un altro valore</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non possiamo aggiornare i valori negli array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Accediamo al valore tramite il suo indice, poi assegniamo un altro valore.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 147909,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A quali indici possiamo accedere in un array con due elementi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code> e <code>1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code> e <code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>0</code> e <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 147910,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifica il valore <code>false</code> in questo array.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"32\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameOptions = [\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 147911,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assicurati che <code>\"sword\"</code> si trovi all'indice <code>0</code> e che <code>\"shield\"</code> si trovi all'indice <code>1</code>, inserendo prima <code>\"sword\"</code> e poi <code>\"shield\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;bow&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" equipment = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(equipment);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"sword\"</code>, seguito da <code>\"shield\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 147912,
